    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/852610/extras/818d926ac1fb5aa4a249daed33396160.avif?t=1667031643\" /></div><br><br><strong>Space of one Drama</strong> is an unusual <strong>puzzle-adventure</strong> game with <strong>action elements</strong>.<br><br>The main character and a little boy are on an extraordinary adventure in a mysterious theater of the imagination. Face various puzzles and use costumes with special abilities to defeat the guardians of the theater!<br><br>Play as, among others, a wizard with power over a levitating anvil, or an astronaut with a jet pack. By skillfully using the costumes and props, you will be able to solve the mystery of the grand theater.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/852610/extras/c894edb039c3734e9749fa5ed5f3b9d7.webp?t=1667031643\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Logical puzzles with action elements<br></li><li> Great clashes with guardians of the theater<br></li><li> Variety of costumes with special abilities<br></li><li> A story told on the stages of a mysterious theater<br></li><li> Full controller suport<br></li><li> New trailer coming soon (the current one is from the pre-alpha version)</li></ul>",
